  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Growth Equity Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GGEF is a first of its kind climate-focused fund in India that focuses on decarbonization of energy and resource efficiency by providing capital to accelerate uptake of green infrastructure projects.

&#x2022; GCF plays a catalytic role in implemeting highly impactful solutions through private sector mobilization by providing a first loss risk protection to private investors.
&#x2022; GGEF is focused on demonstrating proof of concept through innovative, scalable business models in a broader set of climate mitigation sectors. 
&#x2022; Unlike exisiting infrastructure funds in India, with GCF&apos;&apos;s participation, GGEF will become a climate-focused fund bringing the climate angle to its investment process, strategy and criteria.</narrative>
  </description>
